39103>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
39103>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
39103>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
39103>>>>>        Handle hoDD
39103>>>>>
39103>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
39104>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
39105>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
39106>>>>>
